index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..ff037eeec3eed880a10d5cff90a7c8b6b87feb81
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/verification/team-public-retention/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# Retain both published Team presentations
+
+The proposed Team renderer previously recognized only fpv38. A real fpv50 envelope from the accepted v0.78 presentation was rejected after changing the page default. The retained failing test records that regression.
+
+A code-owned exact association registry now covers both published manifests. Restoration selects the corresponding complete picture/audio context; it never substitutes the current or older manifest. Build validation requires both original manifests and their complete core-offline dependencies.
+
+The complete ownership and packager cohorts pass43 tests on each Node20.19.5 and22.22.2 after formatting. They include actual envelope export-byte preservation, wrong-manifest rejection, missing/corrupt/excluded fpv50 files, cancellation/disposal and packaging. Browser/device acceptance is separate.
+
+Current source-stage51 was compiled from accepted music ledger50 with the Team additions. All accepted historical records and audio selection remain intact; both published runtime byte streams are retained exactly. This is unreviewed integration work, not an accepted or published game release.
